id: pm-38w3ii
title: Adopt immutable TruffleHog 3.98.0 after the release-age boundary
description: "Dependabot PR 1449 includes TruffleHog 3.98.0, published 2026-10-05T17:39:02Z. It becomes eligible at 2026-10-12T17:39:02Z under the unchanged seven-day policy. The connected SDK delivery adopts the older eligible CodSpeed update separately; keep this exact scanner pin as a visible open follow-up without hiding it in completed dependency work."
type: Chore
status: closed
priority: 3
tags: []
created_at: "2026-10-12T14:28:16.814Z"
updated_at: "2026-10-18T05:27:11.036Z"
closed_at: "2026-10-18T05:27:10.188Z"
completed_at: "2026-10-18T05:27:10.188Z"
author: "harness:codex"
estimated_minutes: 90
acceptance_criteria: "Recheck exact official tag/commit and seven-day eligibility; update only the immutable scanner pin and relevant workflow contract; native actionlint, permissions, secret scanning and hosted security checks pass; record source and checks through PM before close."
parent: pm-u9d0
risk: low
confidence: high
resolution: Pin the eligible TruffleHog3.98.0 action commit and its explicit3.98.0 scanner input; guard both values on every parsed workflow step and document composite-action selectors.
expected_result: "The workflow executes the intended release instead of the composite action default latest, with unchanged verification, permissions and release-age policy."
actual_result: "The contract failed before the input fix and the full linked suite passes after it. The exact official container reports3.98.0 with pull digest0f32a1d73e552eaf528a4ac0800a26d32169d159bcd77303c833eb9dcdcb848b. Native actionlint, permissions and cooldown checks pass. The final reviewed head must pass hosted secret scanning and all required checks before merge."
