close_reason: Bind the executed scanner version as well as the action ref for reviewed delivery in PR1495.
body: "Proposal: https://github.com/unbraind/pm-cli/pull/1449. Official release: https://github.com/trufflesecurity/trufflehog/releases/tag/v3.98.0. Proposed immutable action commit: 0186870afd2c4a90def791d80260923ba583d076. Current 3.97.9 has no reported vulnerability and verified scanning remains enabled. No ignore rule or cooldown exception is introduced."
